    {
      "id": "seg:heading:declaration:0005:0001",
      "source": "Declaration",
      "ko": "Declaration",
      "sourceHash": "7609342dc466589fdf6cb15b3c6d44a70ad491cf72cc8051cd04d8e03fd9078b",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:declaration:0006:0001",
      "source": "```swift\n@preconcurrency\nfunc drop(while predicate: @escaping (Self.Element) async -> Bool) -> AsyncDropWhileSequence<Self>\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\n@preconcurrency\nfunc drop(while predicate: @escaping (Self.Element) async -> Bool) -> AsyncDropWhileSequence<Self>\n```",
      "sourceHash": "a9f35f826b267c20d456a746e70d76dc5c8cc3f61ad49aee2f8200ec5641455e",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:return-value:0007:0001",
      "source": "Return Value",
      "ko": "반환 값",
      "sourceHash": "4329767c30021f6eaae64eded9b3b1f59c1b1fe672ac5d4a30e3324691f43a1d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:return-value:0008:0001",
      "source": "An asynchronous sequence that skips over values from the base sequence until the provided closure returns `false`.",
      "ko": "제공된 클로저가 `false`를 반환할 때까지 기본 시퀀스의 값을 건너뛰는 비동기 시퀀스입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "1ff32016885c443294e1b82d910512d78e3aefdb2eeeb2d80213bdbd4872e8ee",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "Discussion",
      "ko": "Discussion",
      "sourceHash": "5eb6cf647d2c5d14a044e2d103dcef4cf0cdc872434c374debc1043092bc4746",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "Use `drop(while:)` to omit elements from an asynchronous sequence until the element received meets a condition you specify.",
      "ko": "`drop(while:)`를 사용해 비동기 시퀀스에서 수신한 요소가 지정한 조건을 충족할 때까지 요소를 생략할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "e87b76e32ea3bc9311a225007a7bd8d4013cf9a8c2076a9be9fdf0ade082556d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "In this example, an asynchronous sequence called `Counter` produces `Int` values from `1` to `10`.",
      "ko": "이 예제에서 `Counter`라는 비동기 시퀀스는 `1`에서 `10`까지의 `Int` 값을 생성합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "1f7626545a0e12ba857d2990fe6e1beeb09c6f119a2f26fafb7630bf9af5a6f3",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0002",
      "source": "The `drop(while:)` method causes the modified sequence to ignore received values until it encounters one that is divisible by `3`:",
      "ko": "`drop(while:)` 메서드는 수정된 시퀀스가 `3`으로 나누어 떨어지는 값을 만날 때까지 수신한 값을 무시합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "3556b2d3c89959fcdec5edd5c487fc8741fb7b6dcb0176868ecad0980a2e0f6b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0012:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nlet stream = Counter(howHigh: 10)\n    .drop { $0 % 3 != 0 }\nfor await number in stream {\n    print(number, terminator: \" \")\n}\n// Prints \"3 4 5 6 7 8 9 10 \"\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nlet stream = Counter(howHigh: 10)\n    .drop { $0 % 3 != 0 }\nfor await number in stream {\n    print(number, terminator: \" \")\n}\n// Prints \"3 4 5 6 7 8 9 10 \"\n```",
      "sourceHash": "18274cc09ef7d9da1cffec189bd5a861de588ac9dd0285016f4c7250b134891c",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0013:0001",
      "source": "After the predicate returns `false`, the sequence never executes it again, and from then on the sequence passes through elements from its underlying sequence as-is.",
      "ko": "프레디케이트가 `false`를 반환하면 시퀀스가 다시 이를 실행하지 않으며, 이후에는 기본 시퀀스의 요소를 그대로 전달합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "edb1bd1b72a914312b29ca79b6ec9d7083a2cab2582fea6104fff29ebd15bc59",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:parameters:0014:0001",
      "source": "Parameters",
      "ko": "Parameters",
      "sourceHash": "e68b36b17cbd990802f57741cb75cf3a73fa66a61999b0cd70e3cf7d26cfb25f",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0015:0001",
      "source": "`predicate`: A closure that takes an element as a parameter and   returns a Boolean value indicating whether to drop the element from the   modified sequence.",
      "ko": "`predicate`: 요소를 매개변수로 받아 해당 요소를 수정된 시퀀스에서 삭제할지 여부를 나타내는 불리언 값을 반환하는 클로저입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "3867f8243e4cd3bfee1d7caca1f3c7c395a5d1b5f053e83cb8bfa3bc597047b5",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
